Below is the improved implementation of the Lumen web application that provides an API to convert zip files into a single text file. The application is structured according to the requirements specified, with added error handling and security measures.

<FILEPATH>
bootstrap/app.php
</FILEPATH>
<CODE>
<?php

require_once __DIR__.'/../vendor/autoload.php';

$app = new Laravel\Lumen\Application(
    dirname(__DIR__)
);

